cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fortran_quaternions: quaternions that behave like Fortran's complex type"
type: software
abstract: >-
  fortran_quaternions is a Fortran module, quaternions, with the quaternion
  types quat_sp, quat_dp and quat_qp (real32, real64 and real128 components)
  that behave like the intrinsic complex type: arithmetic with reals and
  integers, the elementary functions with the same principal branches, exact
  comparison, and text I/O. It also provides 3D rotations: axis-angle,
  rotation matrices, ZYX Euler angles, slerp and uniform random rotations.
  It is pure Fortran 2008 and builds with fpm or make.
authors:
